<title>INDIA: India Procter surges 8 pct on bonus news.</title>
<headline>India Procter surges 8 pct on bonus news.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Procter &amp; Gamble India Ltd. rose sharply at Bombay exchanges on Tuesday following news that the firm would meet on August 21 to consider a bonus equity share issue, traders said.</p>
<p>At 12.20 p.m. (0650 GMT), the stock had rallied 71.25 rupees, or eight percent, to 962.0 at the Bombay Stock Exchange (BSE) in volumes of over 58,000 shares.</p>
